1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Every pay cut gets this wrong.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Take twenty off, put twenty back. You get nine sixty.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,400
They cut your pay twenty percent. A year later, they restore it.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,600
But twenty percent of what?

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,200
It came off a thousand. It went back onto eight hundred.

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,800
Cut the thousand into ten blocks. The cut takes two whole blocks.

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:28,400
The rise only gives back one point six.

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:32,000
That gap is your forty. You need twenty-five percent.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,800
Down twenty needs up twenty-five. Down fifty needs up a hundred.
